Intro (Ab - G) DbM 7 Ab 2 /C (Ab – G) DbM 7 Fm 11
{ci: Ab - G) DbM 7 Ab 2 /C *Db/F Ab Eb 2 /G (repeat first two lines}
*2nd time: Db/F Eb/G Ab

{comment: Chorus}
DbM 7 Ab/C DbM 7 Fm 11 DbM 7 Ab/C Fm 7 Ab Eb/G Ab Ab/C
Hallelujah, hallelujah. Hallelujah, Lord, You reign.
DbM 7 Ab/C DbM 7 Fm 11 DbM 7 Ab/C Db/F Eb/G Ab
Hallelujah, hallelujah. Hallelujah, Lord, You reign.

{comment: Verse}
Db Eb Fm 7 Eb Eb/Db Db Eb Fm 7 Eb Eb/Db Db
Lord, You reign in majesty. Lord, You reign victoriously.
Eb Fm 7 Eb/Db Db Db/F Eb/G Ab Eb/G
Lord, You reign gloriously. Lord, You reign. Reign...

{comment: Bridge}
Db Eb Fm 7 Eb
Reign, reign, reign. (repeat)
Db Eb Fm 7 Gm7
Reign, reign, reign, reign.
Db Eb Fm 7 Eb
Reign, reign, reign. (repeat as desired)

{comment: Interlude}
Fm 7 (Return to Chorus to end)
